//@version=5
indicator("TradingBrain - GOLD M1 VLB/VHB - 40 Trades", overlay=true)
// VLB = SELLs, VHB = BUYs (from 40Trades.json)
// Best Setup: BT 0.382 & FTB 0.382
// Best Hour: 17:00 NY
// Plot logic:
// - Detect M1 BOS/CHoCH breaks
// - Plot VLB (bearish engulf at highs) as red triangle down for SELL
// - Plot VHB (bullish engulf at lows) as green triangle up for BUY
// - Plot BT 0.382 FVG zone
// - NO strategy() calls, only indicator() - visual only, HOLD mode
// - Show table: Total 40 Trades | Winrate | Avg R | PF 4.76

// The statements above are user-provided, not independently verified. The
// 40Trades.json file was not supplied to this script; it does not read a journal.
// "Best" setup/hour and PF are claims, not measured results. The 17:00 NY
// claim differs from an earlier proposed 14:00-16:00 NY filter; neither is verified.
// This file is a comment-only skeleton. Detection, plots, FVG zones and the
// table above are NOT implemented. It produces no trading signal or orders.
// Earlier clarified definitions: VLB sells continue to a new lower low; VHB
// buys continue to a new higher high after M5 confirmation. The highs/lows
// wording above needs clarification before it can be coded as detection logic.
// Study only; review manually. Not financial advice. Not compiled in TradingView.
// A hidden placeholder satisfies the indicator's output requirement; no markers are plotted.
plot(na, title="Placeholder - no signals", display=display.none)
